RECOMMENDATION:
The Development Office recommends the Final Plat proceed to the
governing body with the following conditions:
Minimum requirements by law:

1. Show drainage easements satisfactory to the City Engineer before signatures are affixed
to the map.
2. Add “and do hereby dedicate for public use the rights-of-way of Storey Boulevard, Blue
Bluff and Canyon Road as shown thereon.”

STAFF REPORT UPDATE (4/3/12):
At its regular meeting on Monday, April 2, 2012,
the Cheyenne Planning Commission recommended approval of the Final Plat by a unanimous
vote of 4 to 0, with staff conditions 1 and 2.ular meeting on March 5, 2012, the Cheyenne
Planning Commission recommended approval of the above described Final Plat.
